@startuml
title Tamper-proof release pipeline (TAM-001..012)
start
:Locked CI runner checks out tagged release;
:Build frontend (minify + mangle);
:Encrypt UI assets, embed in Rust binary (TAM-001);
:Compile release: fat LTO, strip symbols,\nno debug info, devtools removed (TAM-002);
:Compile-time string encryption (TAM-003);
:Obfuscate hc-licence + pack-decrypt modules (TAM-008);
:Hash code sections, sign manifest via hardware key\n(MVP2: KMS/HSM),\ninject into binary (TAM-005);
:Authenticode (EV) / GPG sign via HSM (TAM-006);
:Build installers (NSIS/MSI, AppImage/deb), sign;
if (Release scan passes?\nno symbols, no devtools, no plain secrets,\nsignatures valid, Defender + AV clean) then (yes)
  :Publish to update server + offline USB package;
  stop
else (no)
  #pink:Block release, alert team;
  stop
endif
@enduml
